### 0b. Core Definitions

| Definition | Source | Description |
|------------|--------|-------------|
| `GF216Poly` | `Basic/Defs.lean` | Abbreviation `GF216[X]` — polynomials over `GF(2¹⁶)`. |
| `listToGF216Poly` | `Basic/Defs.lean` | Canonical map from `List GF16` to `GF216Poly` (ascending degree). |
| `Poly.toGF216Poly` | `Basic/Defs.lean` | Bridge from the Aeneas-extracted `Poly` to `GF216Poly`. |
| `Poly.evalAt` | `Eval.lean` | Evaluation of an Aeneas `Poly` at a `GF16` point as an element of `GF216`. |
| `prodLinearFactors` | `LinearFactors/Basic.lean` | Product `∏_{i=start..stop} (X − ptsᵢ.x)` of linear factors. |
| `lagrangeDenomProd` | `Lagrange/DenomProd.lean` | Lagrange denominator `∏_{j ≠ i} (xᵢ − xⱼ)` in `GF216`. |
| `lagrangeScaleGF216` | `Lagrange/BasisPoly.lean` | The scalar `pᵢ.y / lagrangeDenomProd` used for the i-th basis. |
| `lagrangeBasisPoly` | `Lagrange/BasisPoly.lean` | The i-th Lagrange basis polynomial scaled by its `y` value. |
| `lagrangeInterpolantSum` | `Lagrange/InterpolantSum.lean` | `Σ_i lagrangeBasisPoly i` — the full Lagrange interpolant. |
| `hornerAccum` | `Horner/Defs.lean` | Tail accumulator `g_x · Σ_{i≥k} aᵢ·xⁱ⁻ᵏ` used by `compute_at`. |
| `expectedTrailingPoly` | `ExpectedTrailing/Defs.lean` | Expected state of the trailing coefficients during `lagrange_interpolate_prepare`. |

